From 8161d53a3361e9e7f09a826c35d84195229b640b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 16:38:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] ADD selected-agent slash routing so backend commands
 bypass prompt sends

Selected-agent chat treats raw slash-prefixed input as backend command execution, queues it behind busy sessions, and serializes Codex command turns per agent so provider commands like /status and /fork do not go through the normal prompt path.
